hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"20926","Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi narrated to us, Mushmail ibn Iyas narrated to us, he said: I heard Amr ibn Sulaym al-Muzani say: I heard Rafi ibn Amr al-Muzani say: I heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, say: Ajwah and rock are from Paradise."
